    "Due" : {
      "comment" : "A column of the Cards window's All Tags: how many of the tag's cards are due now.\nA column of the Cards window: when the card is due.\nAn item of the Cards window's sidebar: the cards due now.\nIn the Cards window's detail: when the card is due."
