    },
    "Ficha reads a text file with one card per line: its front, back, tags, type and source, separated by tabs, commas or semicolons, as a spreadsheet, an AI or Anki's Notes in Plain Text save it. Cards with images or sounds come in a zip, with the text file and those files. Anki's decks come in from the .apkg files Anki exports." : {
